msgid "Advanced plus"
msgstr "进阶设置"

msgid "Advanced Setting"
msgstr "高级设置"

msgid "Advanced Edit"
msgstr "进阶参数编辑"

msgid "Loading plugins"
msgstr "加载插件"

msgid "The enhanced version of the original advanced settings can set some supporting services and functions of the firmware"
msgstr "原高级设置的增强版，可配置固件的部分配套服务和功能。"

msgid "The enhanced version of the original advanced settings allows for unified setting and management of background images for kucat/Agron/Opentopd themes, without the need to upload them separately. Color schemes for kucat/Agron/design themes can be set.<br>"
msgstr "原高级设置的增强版，可统一设置和管理 KuCat、Argon、OpenTopd 主题背景，无需分别上传；还可设置 KuCat、Argon、Design 主题的配色方案。<br>"

msgid "At the same time, important plugin parameters can be compiled. At the same time, some system parameters can also be set, such as display and hide settings."
msgstr "同时可配置重要插件参数及部分系统参数，例如显示和隐藏选项。"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Show or hide the setup wizard menu"
msgstr "显示或隐藏设置向导菜单"

msgid "Hide Wizard"
msgstr "隐藏设置向导"

msgid "Prevent uhttpd from exiting web services"
msgstr "防止 uhttpd Web 服务退出"

msgid "Console account password login"
msgstr "控制台账号密码登录"

msgid "No backend menu required"
msgstr "不需要后台菜单"

msgid "OPENWRT backend and SSH login do not display shortcut menus"
msgstr "OpenWrt 后台和 SSH 登录时不显示快捷菜单"

msgid "Add Android host name mapping"
msgstr "添加 Android 主机名映射"

msgid "Resolve the issue of Android native TV not being able to connect to WiFi for the first time"
msgstr "解决原生 Android TV 首次无法连接 Wi-Fi 的问题"

msgid "TSO optimization for network card interruption"
msgstr "网卡断流 TSO 优化"

msgid "Turn off the TSO parameters of the INTEL225 network card to improve network interruption"
msgstr "关闭 Intel I225 网卡的 TSO 参数以改善网络断流。"

msgid "Set up firewall for external network access"
msgstr "设置防火墙的外网访问规则"

msgid "accept"
msgstr "接受"

msgid "drop"
msgstr "丢弃"

msgid "reject"
msgstr "拒绝"

msgid "Choose to load and install the app store, DOCKER, all drivers, etc"
msgstr "选择加载并安装应用商店、Docker、全部驱动等。"

msgid "</br>For specific usage, see:"
msgstr "</br>具体使用说明请参阅："

msgid "<a href='https://github.com/sirpdboy/luci-app-advancedplus.git' target='_blank'>GitHub @sirpdboy/luci-app-advancedplus </a>"
