msgstr "在后台打开地址时使用 HTTPS 安全访问。"

msgid "Wallpaper synchronization"
msgstr "壁纸同步"

msgid "Is the login wallpaper consistent with the desktop wallpaper? If not selected, it indicates that the desktop wallpaper and login wallpaper are set independently."
msgstr "登录壁纸是否与桌面壁纸保持一致？未选择时，桌面壁纸和登录壁纸将独立设置。"

msgid "CPU scheduling mode"
msgstr "CPU 调度模式"

msgid "Dynamic scheduling (default)"
msgstr "动态调度（默认）"

msgid "Highest performance"
msgstr "最高性能"

msgid "Energy saving mode"
msgstr "节能模式"

msgid "The higher the CPU tuning performance, the faster the speed, and the higher the energy consumption. The energy-saving mode has the lowest CPU frequency and saves the most power. Dynamic debugging adjusts CPU frequency and voltage based on CPU load to achieve optimal performance and energy efficiency balance"
msgstr "CPU 性能调节越高，速度越快、能耗也越高。节能模式的 CPU 频率最低，最省电；动态调度会根据 CPU 负载调整频率和电压，以平衡性能与能效。"

msgid "TTL value lock"
msgstr "TTL 值锁定与安全性"

msgid "Extending the transmission distance of data packets in the network and improving network security"
msgstr "延长数据包在网络中的传输距离，并提升网络安全性。"

msgid "Qos automatic optimization"
msgstr "QoS 自动优化"

